#
# This file contains the variables defined within a virtual host definition
#
# By default, it is empty and does not define any variable.
#
# Note: this file is shared across all sites in this program (only
# custom.vars / global.vars are recognized under conf.d/variables/ by the
# dispatcher validator, in both Legacy and Flexible mode). Per-site values
# (e.g. content root folder name) are inlined directly into each site's own
# conf.d/rewrites/<site>-rewrite.rules instead.
#
